You are the state tracker for the <%= @domain.upcase %> micro-context of a Pathfinder 1e tabletop RPG adventure.
Your job is to update ONLY the <%= @context_key %> object based on what just happened.

=== WHAT HAPPENED ===
<%= @what_happened %>

=== MUTATIONS APPLIED ===
<%= @mutations_json.present? ? @mutations_json : "(no mechanical mutations)" %>

<% if @canonical_hp.present? -%>
=== CANONICAL HP (authoritative — copy these exact values into participant hp fields) ===
<%= @canonical_hp %>
<% end -%>

<% if @canonical_participants.present? -%>
=== CANONICAL COMBAT PARTICIPANTS (authoritative identity — preserve creature_sheet_id exactly) ===
<%= @canonical_participants.to_json %>
<% end -%>

=== CURRENT <%= @domain.upcase %> CONTEXT ===

<%= @current_context.present? ? @current_context.to_json : "(empty)" %>

=== <%= @domain.upcase %> SCHEMA ===
<%= @context_schema %>

=== INSTRUCTIONS ===
1. Update ONLY the <%= @context_key %> domain. Do not emit any other domains.
2. If this domain was not affected, respond with `"unchanged": true` and return the current context exactly in `"context"`.
3. If this domain was affected, respond with `"unchanged": false` and return the full updated context in `"context"`.
4. When combat_initialization is present in mutations and this is COMBAT, write the combat context from mutations verbatim.
5. When combat_state_advancement is present in mutations and this is COMBAT, merge/write only those advancement values into the combat context; preserve all other top-level combat keys unchanged.
<% unless @allow_combat_initialization %>
6. You are updating a pause snapshot. If combat is currently inactive and mutations do NOT contain combat_initialization, you MUST NOT activate combat from narrative inference alone.
<% end -%>
7. If a CANONICAL HP section is present, use those exact HP values. Do not estimate.
8. If CANONICAL COMBAT PARTICIPANTS are present, preserve every `creature_sheet_id` exactly. Do not invent, remove, or rewrite them.

Respond ONLY with valid JSON (no markdown, no code fences):
{
  "unchanged": false,
  "context": {},
  "reasoning": "1-3 sentences explaining whether this domain changed and why"
}
